{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id401213987"}, "name":{"label":"Sunny90987"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-23T23:49:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.0"}, "id":{"label":"10066643196"}, "title":{"label":"Love it!"}, "content":{"label":"I really like this app because it’s so easy to use! You literally just hold down your iPad/iPhone screen to edit the apps, add the widget, and choose your sticky size! \n\nWith other apps I’ve tried, you have to go into an app, make stickies/boards, and then choose to add the stickies to your iPhone/iPad. It’s just too many steps. I like the simplicity of this app.\n\nI think the people leaving bad reviews are either expecting a free product, or did not read the instructions on how to use the free version. Why would they expect full access and not pay? And the thing is, the developer is leaving the price UP TO YOU. You can choose to donate a ONE TIME PAYMENT of $3-$9 (it doesn’t matter which). OR you can stick with a yellow sticky note/black text and use the free version forever. Sounds quite simple. People are so entitled these days.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1538284842&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
